@startuml
title John Bill Generation

participant "Bill Generation Management" as BGM #red
participant "Billing Account Management" as BAM #red
participant "Bill Calculation Management" as BCM

BGM -> BGM : 1. CycleEventTimer trigger
note right of BGM : Internal Timer triggers the Bill generation process on 1st October

group loop [These steps are processed for each execute Timer]

    BGM -> BGM : 2. **TMF666 Account Management:**\nGET /billingCycleSpecification?billigDateShift=1&billingPeriod=Monthly&chargeDateOffset=0\n-->billingCycleSpecificationId= 12,15,16...
    note right of BGM
      We will retrieve all the IDs of the billing cycle specifications where:
      -- The billing date is equal to the start of the month,
      -- The billing cycle type is monthly,
      -- There is no offset (in days) for the date at which the charges received by the billing system will appear on the invoice.
    end note

    BGM -> BAM : 4. **TMF666 Account Management:**\nGET /billingAccount?(billStructure.cycleSpecification.id=12,15,16)
    activate BAM
    BAM --> BGM : 5. 200 OK (BillingAccountId = 7,8,9)
    deactivate BAM
    note right of BGM : we illustrate the example of John billing account

    group This operation should be performed for all `billingAccountId` results obtained from flow 5. For illustration purposes, we will use John's billing account (id7) as an example

        BGM -> BGM : 6. **TMF666 Account Management**: GET /billingAccount/billingAccount.id=7 ?(billStructure.format, billStructure.presentationMedia, relatedParty, billSructure.cycleSpecification)
        BGM --> BGM : 7. 200 OK (billStructure.format, billStructure.cycleSpecification, relatedParty, billStructure.presentationMedia) for BillingAccountId.Id7

        BGM -> BCM : 8. **TMF678 Customer Bill Mgt:**GET /AppliedCustomerBillingProductRate\n?(billingAccount.Id=7 & AppliedCustomerBillingProductRate.Id & AppliedCustomerBillingProductRate.Type & AppliedCustomerBillingProductRate.Value)
        activate BCM
        BCM --> BGM : 9. 200 OK\nResponse:\n\nbillingAccountId: 7,AppliedCustomerBillingProductRates:\n[Id: 1, Type: Usage, Value: ...],\n[Id: 2, Type: OneTime, Value: ...],\n[Id: 3, Type: Recurring, Value: ...],\n[Id: 4, Type: Discount, Value: ...],\n[Id: 5, Type: Tax, Value: ...]
        deactivate BCM

        BGM -> BGM : 10. **TMF678 Customer Bill Mgt:**\nPOST /customerBillManagement/customerBill\n(BillingAcountId.Id7, billDate="2023-10-01T00:00:00.000Z",relatedPartyRole="customer",relatedPartyId (John) paymentDueDate,\nAppliedCustomerBillingProductRates: [Id: 1, Type: Usage, Value: ...],\n[Id: 2, Type: OneTime, Value: ...],\n[Id: 3, Type: Recurring, Value: ...],\n[Id: 4, Type: Discount, Value: ...],\n[Id: 5, Type: Tax, Value: ...]\n,amountDue,Status="New",billFormat="Pdf")=>CustomerBillId

    end

end

@enduml
